<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12413] .NET: XMLDoc does not work when using Ignite NuGet from .NET Core</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12413</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Create new .NET Core project (2.x or 3.x): dotnet new console&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Install nightly build of 2.8.0: dotnet add package Apache.Ignite -v 2.8.0-alpha20191118&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Open the project in any IDE (VS, VSCode, Rider) and start using Ignite APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;There is no documentation in IDE tooltips. NuGet package is malformed.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
